(806086, 'Periodic damage dealt now has an $h% chance to summon $806087s1 |cffffffffRotlings|r that will run towards the enemy and explode after $807640t2 sec for ${$500585m1+$500585ppl1+$SP*0.335} Plague damage, increased with your level.', '');
